  {
   "k": "7zpfg7",
   "en": "Restore the Romanovs to the throne and conquer Germany, Hungary, Austria, Czechoslovakia, Turkey, and Bulgaria."
  },
  {
   "k": "1h0k7yc",
   "en": "Strategy"
  },
  {
   "k": "9amwd9",
   "en": "Get military access from the Axis and the Allies during civil war then backstab them is a fast and easy way to achieve this."
  },
  {
   "k": "88muw",
   "en": "As of 1.11.4, if you are at war with other countries as Stalin before starting the civil war, it will be Stalin that keeps fighting them. As the opposer of Stalin, you can get military access from those countries during civil war. Thus, before starting the civil war, justifying war goal on Poland then Germany, as world tension rises, Poland will be guaranteed by the United Kingdom. Then declaring war on them. After the civil war started, they will help you defeat Stalin, returning every piece of Russian land they occupied because you are having a civil war. If you defeated Poland before civil war breaks out and the Allies failed to take it back, in another word, it is occupied by Germany after you declare on Germany, you will even have a peace conference to partition Poland."
  },
  {
   "k": "b5v0kz",
   "en": "You can get everything except Bohemia and Ankara in peace conference at the end of WWII. The remaining two are tricky, because Turkey tends to be guaranteed by multiple parties and Czechoslovakia may be guaranteed by the UK and/or be in the Allies. One way around it is as follows:"
  },
  {
   "k": "1ro2g2n",
   "en": "Before WWII ends but when Czechoslovakia is partly liberated, take \"Panslavic Nationalism\" (make sure to boost opinion of Czechoslovakia to +100). This sends them an offer to be annexed. The odds of acceptance are greatly improved if they are weak compared to you, in your faction, have +95 or higher opinion, and are at war with a major."
  },
  {
   "k": "1mqc081",
   "en": "If they refuse, you have a wargoal against them that you can use later."
  },
  {
   "k": "ht157w",
   "en": "Finish off Germany."
  },
  {
   "k": "13e603k",
   "en": "Leave the Allies (you can't justify wars as part of the Allies)."
  },
  {
   "k": "jua3js",
   "en": "Justify on Afghanistan. It is guaranteed by Turkey, which lets you go to war with Turkey without the hassle of also fighting the entire Allies."
  },
  {
   "k": "1vv0v6d",
   "en": "When Turkey and Afghanistan are capitulated, declare on Czechoslovakia."
  },
  {
   "k": "183wmr5",
   "en": "Worst case scenario, even if Czechoslovakia is in the Allies, the achievement only requires being the ⟦0⟧, not the owner, so, as long as you manage to overrun their capital state without losing any other required states to attacks and naval invasions, the achievement should fire.",
